 2️⃣ Zero-Downtime Strategy (App Service Slots)

 🔁 How Slots Work

 Staging slot → deploy new version
 Warm-up & health check
 Swap slots
 Azure redirects traffic instantly
 Old version becomes fallback

No restart. No connection drop.

