 3️⃣ Azure App Service Setup

 Step 1: Create App Service

 Runtime: Java 17
 OS: Linux
 Plan: Standard (S1+) or Premium

 Step 2: Create Deployment Slot

```bash
az webapp deployment slot create \
  --name springboot-app \
  --resource-group my-rg \
  --slot staging
```

 Step 3: Configure Health Check

In `application.yml`:

```yaml
management:
  endpoints:
    web:
      exposure:
        include: health
```

Azure Portal → App Service → Health Check Path

```
/actuator/health
```

