---

 🔹 Pod Scaling (HPA)

CPU is NOT enough at scale.

```yaml
apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
spec:
  minReplicas: 50
  maxReplicas: 2000
  metrics:
  - type: Resource
    resource:
      name: cpu
      target:
        type: Utilization
        averageUtilization: 60
```

---

 🔹 RPS-Based Scaling (KEDA)

```yaml
apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1
kind: ScaledObject
spec:
  scaleTargetRef:
    name: springboot
  minReplicaCount: 100
  maxReplicaCount: 3000
  triggers:
  - type: prometheus
    metadata:
      serverAddress: http://prometheus
      metricName: http_requests_total
      threshold: "1000"
```

---

 🔹 Node Autoscaler

```bash
--enable-cluster-autoscaler
--min-count 10
--max-count 200
```

Use multiple node pools:

 System
 API
 Batch

